---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import SectionLead from '../ui/SectionLead.astro';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
---

<section id="contact" class="contact section-block">
  <div class="site-container">
    <SectionHeading>CONTACT</SectionHeading>
    <p class="u-text-lg u-mb-md">
      ご連絡は、こちらのフォームよりお気軽にお寄せください。
    </p>
    <div class="contact__action">
      <Button href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe5PNK90HOzHmcaCMBJM1ltv3YyRbgnQpSecnKIUIRCx15aog/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank">Contact Me</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
